Plain `import` statements (named, `import type`, and namespace) aren't declarations, so a file of only imports prints just its path and line count.
== args
input/imports.ts
== file input/imports.ts
import { readFile } from 'node:fs/promises';
import type { Config } from './types';
import * as path from 'node:path';
== stdout
input/imports.ts (3 lines)
== stderr
== exit 0
